    "detailed_description": "If you need a relaxing, eye candy, classic puzzle game, then don't miss the &quot;Beauty Jigsaw&quot;!<br><br>Open the game, select your favorite beautiful girl image, by dragging the pieces to reassemble the image, to enjoy the puzzle fun.<br><br>You can safely close the game while playing and continue the last unfinished game at any time in the future.<br><br>The finished images will be unlocked in the gallery for you to enjoy at any time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 120 carefully selected images of beautiful girls<br></li><li> 25 touching piano pieces<br></li><li> 4 different styles of atlas (Otaku, Realistic, Comics, 3D)<br></li><li> 3 kinds of complexity from easy to difficult</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New feature:</h2> Combined drag and drop<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972300/extras/0d10e8a40dee9aff1a82a5e2bfad90cd.poster.avif?t=1723607640\" width=210 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972300/extras/0d10e8a40dee9aff1a82a5e2bfad90cd.webm?t=1723607640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972300/extras/0d10e8a40dee9aff1a82a5e2bfad90cd.mp4?t=1723607640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "If you need a relaxing, eye candy, classic puzzle game, then don't miss the &quot;Beauty Jigsaw&quot;!<br><br>Open the game, select your favorite beautiful girl image, by dragging the pieces to reassemble the image, to enjoy the puzzle fun.<br><br>You can safely close the game while playing and continue the last unfinished game at any time in the future.<br><br>The finished images will be unlocked in the gallery for you to enjoy at any time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 120 carefully selected images of beautiful girls<br></li><li> 25 touching piano pieces<br></li><li> 4 different styles of atlas (Otaku, Realistic, Comics, 3D)<br></li><li> 3 kinds of complexity from easy to difficult</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New feature:</h2> Combined drag and drop<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972300/extras/0d10e8a40dee9aff1a82a5e2bfad90cd.poster.avif?t=1723607640\" width=210 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972300/extras/0d10e8a40dee9aff1a82a5e2bfad90cd.webm?t=1723607640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972300/extras/0d10e8a40dee9aff1a82a5e2bfad90cd.mp4?t=1723607640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
